GLiFormer Large NER Android host sample

The pairing decoder is a Kotlin port of Knowledgator GLiFormer 0.1.2
(tasks/span_decoder.py and tasks/ner/decoder.py), Apache License 2.0.
Changes include Kotlin float32 arrays, packed-logit binding and conversion
between Python code-point offsets and Java UTF-16 indices. Preprocessing
follows GLiFormer 0.1.2 and GLiNER 0.2.29, both Apache License 2.0.

The tokenizer follows the published DeBERTa SentencePiece Unigram JSON.
Tokenizer structure and the standalone Gradle shell were adapted from
LiteRT-Models' GLiNER2.5 Android sample (Apache License 2.0).

Model and host assets are downloaded separately from
litert-community/GLiFormer-Large-NER-LiteRT. The model source is
knowledgator/gliformer-large-v1 at revision
d0a4e53d09cebe6bc963dd9be319d4279084bb2d, declared Apache License 2.0.
The DeBERTa MIT notice covers code lineage, not an independent license
for the unavailable knowledgator/DeBERTa-large-joint-3000 base-weight card.
Transformers tokenizer/runtime code is Apache License 2.0.

Gradle wrapper files retain their original Apache License 2.0 headers.
Original model/runtime/encoder licenses are retained under licenses/.
